  fullText: Entry 3\n\nThe Visitor appears to be made out of a metal composed of
    several\nknown minerals. However, there are some unidentifiable components\nthat
    give further evidence to my theory.\nWhile we continue analyzing its structure,
    I have begun researching\nhow it interacts when in contact with water, as the
    reports indicated\nthat might be what caused it to "open".
